author\">Hyp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Dem.Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ Μουσείου</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">104.4</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῶν κοπρώνων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25.49</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">governor</b>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">administrator</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τῆς πόλεως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">254.3</span> </span> (Babylon, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12(3).320.7</span> </span> (Thera, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OGI</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">479.7</span> </span> (Dorylaeum, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii A.D.</span>); <span class=\"gk\">κώμης</span> local <b class=\"lex-tr\">magistrate,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arch.Pap.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.38</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span>. = προστάτης, Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">patronus,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">IG</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.1317</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span>. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Av.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">437</span> </span>, = χυτρόπους, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.Byz.</s